    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'In this tutorial, you learned how to simulate Global Illumination with precomputed lighting.


      For more information about baked lighting, watch this <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hMnetI4-dNY">video tutorial</a>  and check out the <a href="https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/LightingOverview.html">documentation.</a>


      <b>Note:</b> You do not need to save your changes in order to follow other tutorials.'
